  "created": "2026-10-27T19:56:22.71Z",
  "description": "把 Ozakboy.Line 包成一組 MCP 工具,讓外部 AI(Claude、自訂連接器、任何 MCP 用戶端)查詢官方帳號狀態、擬廣播、改自動回覆規則與訊息範本、替換圖文選單。鐵則是「AI 不得直接發送」:預設的 Review 模式下,所有送出類工具只寫進待審佇列,核准與發送的 API 不暴露成工具,只留給宿主程式;每日建立數另有上限。對外掛載形式為 /mcp/line/{金鑰},金鑰驗證失敗一律回 404 而不是 401/403,不對外暴露端點存在。Exposes Ozakboy.Line as a set of MCP tools so an outside AI — Claude, a custom connector, any MCP client — can read an official account's state, draft broadcasts, edit auto reply rules and message templates, and replace rich menus. The rule is that the AI cannot send: in the default Review mode every sending tool only writes to a review queue, the approve-and-send API is not exposed as a tool and belongs to the host, and a daily cap limits how much can be queued. It mounts at /mcp/line/{key}, and a failed key check answers 404 rather than 401 or 403, so the endpoint's existence is never advertised.",
