  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0: version bump alongside the core package. The line_send_push, line_send_multicast and line_send_broadcast tools accept template and imagemap message JSON exactly as they accept every other message type: the array is queued and sent verbatim, and the outbox summary names the type. No tool was added or renamed, the review queue and daily cap are unchanged, and the key gate still answers 404 on any failure. See https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Line/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
